   "sec": "ap-chronic",
   "html": "<h5>Chronic cough (> 3 wks) — causes by chest X-ray and spirometry (Blackbook)</h5><ul><li><b>Abnormal chest X-ray</b>: COPD; Chronic Infection (Eg. Fungal, Tuberculosis); Neoplasm; CHF; Interstitial Disease; Foreign Body</li><li><b>Normal chest X-ray</b><ul><li><b>Obstructive disease</b> (FEV<sub>1</sub>/FVC &lt;75%): Asthma; COPD</li><li><b>Normal spirometry</b><ul><li><b>Upper airway</b>: Post-Nasal Drip / Rhinosinusitis; Neuromuscular Swallowing Disorder; Thyroiditis; Mediastinal Mass; Elongated Uvula</li><li><b>Lower airway</b>: Asthma; GERD; Post-Infectious; Smoker’s Cough; Non-Asthmatic Eosinophilic Bronchitis; Foreign Body</li><li><b>Other</b>: ACE Inhibitor</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>"
  }
